              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanyuma wa muzezwarugo Eliyakimu mwene Hilukiya, n’ umukarani Shebuna, n’umwanditsi w’ivyaja biraba yitwa Yowa mwene Asafu, baza kuri Hezekiya bitantamuriyekw impuzu zabo, bamudondera amagambo ya Rabushake.",
